   "source": [
    "### Tips\n",
    "* `.unique()` returns an iterator with all the values of the series (id3 split is based on branches for each category)\n",
    "* `.nunique()` returns the number of unique values (usefull to check if a subgroup is \"pure\")"
   ]
  },
  {
